config EXAMPLES_LEDNODE
	tristate "WS2812 RGB LED feedback daemon (lednode)"
	default n
	depends on ESP_RMT && RMTCHAR
	---help---
		RGB LED animation daemon for openvela ESP32-S3 nodes.
		Provides visual feedback for WiFi state, AI inference,
		heartbeat, HTTP requests, and CPU load via the on-board
		WS2812 LED (GPIO48 or GPIO38) driven through /dev/rmt0.

		Run with: nsh> lednode &

		Other apps (httpnode, inferd) call lednode_base() /
		lednode_flash() macros from lednode.h to signal events.
		In NuttX flat/builtin mode all tasks share the same address
		space, so the shared globals work without IPC overhead.
